    "description": "Library or school, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 469 blocks vs 310 (first build 394 vs 260). Stone reading hall whose front rises into a great round window over the door; book stacks stand out from both walls between the windows, a reading table down the middle, hearth, archive and scribe's desk at the back; L2 fills the stacks with bookshelves and adds the lectern, candles, lanterns, banners, shutters and flower boxes; L3 carpets, a globe and map table, a bench, flowers, vines and a lantern post. Not yet builder-tested: azure_bluet, bookshelf, candle, cartography_table, cornflower, green_carpet, lectern, light_blue_stained_glass, oxeye_daisy, red_wall_banner. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item, item_frame.",
